OL,3,GNEWSADead fish cleared from park pond
OL,4,Aafter dry summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn emergency response team has removed
OL,7,Fdead fish from the surface of a park
OL,8,Fpond.
OL,10,FReading Borough Council said the water
OL,11,Flevel of the pond at Prospect Park had
OL,12,Fbeen left low by the long, dry summer.
OL,14,FIt said in an attempt to keep the fish
OL,15,Falive, it gained permission from Thames
OL,16,FWater for the fire service to top it
OL,17,Fup, but it was only brought to half its
OL,18,Fnormal depth.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
